Nspire USB protocol reference
pc/nspire_usb.py reimplements protocol formats and checksum algorithms described by Vogtinator/libnspire (Daniel Tang, Felix Böttcher), revision 7d7d962ca49ff9017f6f146336c51ef7f2edf4e0, GPL-3.0-or-later. See docs/usb-protocol.md and LICENSE. The default Windows transport uses Microsoft WinUSB supplied with Windows; no TI binary is bundled or required on CX II. The explicitly selected legacy NavNet comparison backend loads only a user's local TI installation.
